----

[Bokeh](https://bokeh.org) is anÂ interactive visualizationÂ library for modern web browsers. It provides elegant, conciseÂ constructionÂ of versatile graphics and affords high-performance interactivity across large or streaming datasets.Â Bokeh can help anyone who wants to create interactive plots, dashboards, and data applications quickly and easily.

